# Git stores LF and checks out whatever the platform wants.
#
# Without this, scripted edits that translate newlines to match a file can
# apply the translation twice and leave CR CR LF inside lines. git then keeps
# half of it, an anchored edit stops matching a line that is plainly there,
# and nothing anywhere renders differently. See
# ui/scripts/the-page-is-the-shape-it-looks.mjs, which now fails on it.
* text=auto
